{
  "uid": "arsw-k6-json-docente",
  "title": "k6 Resultados por ejecucion",
  "tags": [
    "ARSW",
    "k6",
    "docente"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "profile",
        "label": "Perfil",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(lab_k6_summary_p95_ms, profile)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(lab_k6_summary_p95_ms, profile)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "run",
        "label": "Ejecuci\u00f3n",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(lab_k6_summary_p95_ms{profile=~\"${profile:regex}\"}, run)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(lab_k6_summary_p95_ms{profile=~\"${profile:regex}\"}, run)",
          "refId": "VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "C\u00f3mo interpretar este tablero",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Resultados finales de los JSON de `results/`.** Cada barra representa una ejecuci\u00f3n completa. Seleccione perfil y ejecuci\u00f3n arriba. Se actualiza cuando termina una prueba y se escribe su JSON.\n\n**No es una curva en tiempo real.** La ventana temporal del tablero no filtra la fecha de las pruebas: use los identificadores o la tabla de finalizaci\u00f3n UTC. P95 en milisegundos; throughput medio, incluidos errores. Compare latencia y errores juntos. Una barra roja en estr\u00e9s/pico puede ser esperable."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "P95 del cliente",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "lab_k6_summary_p95_ms{profile=~\"${profile:regex}\",run=~\"${run:regex}\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{run}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 2,
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.run}",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      }
    },
    {
